                         You agree to appoint an individual who shall act in the capacity of Your agent andcollect the Prescription Drugs as requested by You from Pharmacy on Your behalf("User Agent"). You accept and acknowledge that the User Agent shall be responsibleto collect the medicines ordered by You from the Pharmacy and to carry it to theaddress notified by You.  You further acknowledge that the User Agent is acting asYour authorized representative in this arrangement and their actions in collecting andtransporting the Prescription Drugs are undertaken with Your consent. ThePlatform’s/Pharmacy’s role is limited to facilitating the connection between You andthe User Agent and it assumes no responsibility for the actions of the User Agent in thecollection or delivery process.

